cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "POTS / Dysautonomia Literature Findings — Tier 1"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it AND the original papers behind any finding you rely on."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Magennis"
    given-names: "Erin"
version: tier1-v1
date-released: "2026-07-29"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  36,459 structured research findings machine-extracted from 3,121 POTS and dysautonomia papers,
  with canonicalized entities, ontology identifiers where a genuine term exists, full source
  attribution, and four discovery tables (associations, under-studied signals, contradictions,
  null/failed results). Tier 1 of a planned four-tier corpus; covers POTS/dysautonomia only.
  Short quoted excerpts remain the copyright of their publishers and are capped at 200 characters.
